sequenceDiagram
    actor Client
    participant API
    participant Processor as PaymentProcessor
    participant Gateway as SimulatedPaymentGateway
    participant Loki
    participant Grafana
    actor Engineer

    Client->>API: POST /payments (Amount 13.37)
    API->>API: Preserve or generate CorrelationId
    Note over API: Request scope: CorrelationId
    API->>Processor: Process payment
    activate Processor
    Note over Processor: Operation scope: PaymentId, CustomerId, Operation
    Processor-->>Loki: Structured payment-start event via Serilog
    Processor->>Gateway: Invoke gateway
    activate Gateway
    Gateway-->>Loki: Structured invocation-start event via Serilog
    Gateway--xProcessor: PaymentGatewayException
    deactivate Gateway
    Processor-->>Loki: Structured error with operation context via Serilog
    Processor--xAPI: PaymentGatewayException
    deactivate Processor
    API-->>Loki: Structured HTTP 500 completion event via Serilog
    API-->>Client: 500 + X-Correlation-ID
    Client-->>Engineer: Report X-Correlation-ID
    Engineer->>Grafana: Search by CorrelationId
    Grafana->>Loki: LogQL query
    Loki-->>Grafana: Correlated diagnostic trail
    Grafana-->>Engineer: PaymentId, context, and failure reason
